<title>USA: FFW Corp to buy First Chicago NBD branch.</title>
<headline>FFW Corp to buy First Chicago NBD branch.</headline>
<dateline>WABASH, Ind. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>FFW Corp, the parent of First Federal Savings Bank, said Monday it signed a definitive agreement to acquire the deposit liabilities and certain assets of an NBD Bank branch in South Whitley, Indiana, from First Chicago NBD Corp.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The deal, which is expected to close in the second quarter, will expand First Federal's market penetration, FFW said. About $18 million in deposits are involved, FFW said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
